## Scope Definition

### In Scope ✅

| # | Item | Details |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Public Donation Page | Cause display, predefined amounts (₹100/₹500/₹1000/₹2000), custom amount, donor form |
| 2 | Razorpay Payment (Test Mode) | Order creation, checkout, signature verification, webhook handling |
| 3 | Thank-You Page | Donation summary with amount, reference ID, date |
| 4 | Admin Login | Email/password via Supabase Auth |
| 5 | Admin Dashboard | Total donations count, total amount, recent 10 donations |
| 6 | Donor Log Table | Name, email, amount, date, payment ID, status — searchable, filterable, paginated |
| 7 | Database Schema | causes, donations, admin_users tables with RLS |
| 8 | API Routes | create-order, verify-payment, webhook, admin endpoints |
| 9 | Mobile Responsive | All pages work on 360px+ screens |
| 10 | Error Handling | Payment failures, validation errors, auth errors |

### Out of Scope ❌

| # | Item | Reason |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Recurring donations | MVP — future enhancement |
| 2 | Email notifications to donors | MVP — future enhancement |
| 3 | 80G tax receipt generation | Requires legal setup, future enhancement |
| 4 | Multi-cause support | MVP — single cause only |
| 5 | Donor account/login | Donors don't need accounts |
| 6 | Social media sharing | MVP — future enhancement |
| 7 | CSV/PDF export | MVP — future enhancement |
| 8 | Mobile app | Web-only for MVP |
| 9 | Multi-currency support | INR only |
| 10 | Razorpay live mode | Test mode only for this project |
| 11 | Multi-language support | English only |
| 12 | Analytics/charts | Basic stats only, no charts in MVP |
| 13 | Admin user management | Single admin, manual setup |
| 14 | Refund processing | Via Razorpay Dashboard only |
| 15 | Payment retry automation | Manual retry by donor |

