## Business Processes

### Process 1: Donation Collection
```
Donor → Visit Donation Page → Select Amount → Fill Info → Pay → Thank You
```

### Process 2: Donor Tracking
```
Payment Webhook → Insert/Update Donation Record → Available in Admin Panel
```

### Process 3: Admin Reporting
```
Admin Login → View Dashboard Stats → View/Search Donor Log → Logout
```

